eparture: 9:00am\nDeparts every hour on the hour (9:00, 10:00, 11:00, etc.)\nLast departure: 9:00pm (10:00pm on Friday & Saturday)\n\n***From Coronado***\n\nFirst departure: 9:30am\nDeparts every hour on the half-hour (9:30, 10:30, 11:30, etc.)\nLast departure: 9:30pm (10:30pm on Friday & Saturday)\n\n###Convention Center Schedule\nDaily ferry service between Coronado Ferry Landing and San Diego Convention Center (5th Avenue). Runs every 30 minutes.\n\n***From Convention Center***\n\nFirst departure: 9:25am\nDeparts at :25 and :55 past the hour (9:25, 9:55, 10:25, etc.)\nLast departure: 9:55pm (10:55pm on Friday & Saturday)\n\n***From Coronado Island***\n\nFirst departure: 9:10am\nDeparts at :10 and :40 past the hour (9:10, 9:40, 10:10, etc.)\nLast departure: 9:40pm (10:40pm on Friday & Saturday)", "cancellation_notes": "#Cancellation Policy\nFerry tickets are non-refundable.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Purchase your Ferry tickets today! | All Ages", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/flagshipsd/items/192837/images/336238/", "pk": 336238, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fSZs4GIXRfOZiJ2rOg7y", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fSZs4GIXRfOZiJ2rOg7y", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/flagshipsd/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/flagshipsd/items/192837/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fSZs4GIXRfOZiJ2rOg7y", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fSZs4GIXRfOZiJ2rOg7y", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/flagshipsd/items/192837/images/336066/", "pk": 336066, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/o3dg2XiSQh4fvq5EM504", "image_cdn_url": "http